1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,128
Today we will learn about our daily routine.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:17,496
A daily routine is what we do every day. It helps us know what comes next.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,136
In the morning, we wake up. We clean ourselves and brush our teeth.

4
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,888
We eat breakfast and get dressed before going to school.

5
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,336
At school, we learn new things and follow our teacher's instructions.

6
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,336
At the end of the day, we get ready for bed. Going to bed on time is a healthy habit.

7
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:13,336
A routine keeps our day organized. First we wake up, and later we go to school. At night we sleep.

8
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:43,336
You have learned about your daily routine. Now try a question from your school study material.
